The program is one file that links all of these statically, with libstdc++ and libgcc. It is the encoder the Debian 13 package libavif-bin 1.2.1-1.2
is (libavif 1.2.1 with libaom 3.12.1 and libyuv 1904), built from the sources above and not from the package, with libaom's own Release flags.
